    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n147 Wyckham Point is an exceptionally spacious three-bedroom, first floor apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development in the heart of Dundrum. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property extends to approximately 132 sq. m/ 1,421 sq ft. and benefits from a superb wrap-around balcony, allowing natural light to flood the accommodation and creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring and recessed lighting. The heart of the home is the impressive open-plan living/dining room, a wonderfully bright and spacious reception area featuring hardwood flooring, recessed lighting and floor-to-ceiling windows which provide excellent natural light and direct access to the expansive wrap-around balcony. The adjoining kitchen is modern in design and fitted with a range of integrated appliances together with ample storage and preparation space. A separate utility room and walk-in storage room provide excellent practicality and additional storage.\n\nThere are three generous double bedrooms, all benefiting from fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom is further enhanced by direct balcony access and a stylish en-suite shower room, while a second bedroom also enjoys the benefit of an en-suite. A spacious fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nWyckham Point is a highly regarded development built by O'Malley Construction and Dorville Homes, surrounded by beautifully maintained landscaped communal grounds. Residents benefit from a 24-hour concierge service, secure underground parking and excellent on-site amenities including a private gym, sauna and steam room facilities.\n\nIdeally located off the Wyckham Bypass, the development is within walking distance of Dundrum Town Centre, Airfield Estate and a host of local shops, cafés and restaurants. Excellent transport links are available with the Luas at Balally nearby, numerous Dublin Bus routes serving the area and easy access to the M50.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial apartment in one of South Dublin's most convenient and desirable residential locations, offering an ideal balance of space, comfort and convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 1.85m x 6.07m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring and recessed lighting.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 14.03m x 4.81m\nExceptionally bright and spacious open-plan living/dining room with hardwood flooring, recessed lighting, two radiators, boiler room and separate storage room. Floor-to-ceiling windows provide excellent natural light and direct access to the impressive wrap-around balcony.\n\nBalcony - \nGenerous wrap-around balcony offering excellent outdoor space.\n\nKitchen - \nTiled flooring and tiled splashback. Fitted with a Neff oven, Neff microwave, Neff hob, Neff extractor hood and Indesit integrated fridge freezer, together with excellent storage and countertop space.\n\nStorage Room - 2.15m x 1.53m\nLarge walk-in storage room fitted with shelving and cupboards.\n\nUtility Room - 2.15m x 1.21m\nTiled flooring with washing machine and additional shelving.\n\nBedroom 1 - 6.23m x 3.47m\nSpacious double bedroom with semi-solid wood flooring, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting, radiator, floor-to-ceiling windows and direct access to the balcony. En-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.61m x 2.21m\nTiled flooring, shower, wash hand basin, w.c., mirrored vanity unit, heated towel rail and recessed lighting.\n\nPrivate Balcony - \nPrivate balcony accessed directly from the principal bedroom.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.67m x 2.34m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, radiator, recessed lighting and en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.60m x 2.20m\nFully tiled en-suite comprising shower, wash hand basin, w.c., mirrored vanity unit, heated towel rail, shelving and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.67m x 2.34m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes, radiator and recessed lighting.\n\nBathroom - 1.60m x 2.20m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath, separate shower, wash hand basin, w.c., mirrored vanity unit, heated towel rail, shelving and recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
